our investment needs. In this video, learn how to quickly apply for treasury services online.\n\nNow you can easily on-board yourself for treasury services on ICICI Bank Corporate Internet Banking:\n- Login to the Dashboard of ICICI Bank Corporate Internet Banking.\n- Select Treasury and then Treasury Onboarding.\n- A Treasury Onboarding form will get displayed.\n- Select the Account Number.\n- All the details would be auto-fetched.\n- Upload the document and check Terms and Conditions.\n- Select Save if you want to submit later.\n- To submit the document now, click on Proceed.\n- Congratulations! You have successfully onboarded yourself for Treasury Onboarding Services.\n\nTo know more about ICICI Corporate Internet Banking:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/corporate/corporate/corporate.page\n\nSubscribe to the ICICI Bank YouTube Channel and remember to press the bell icon to get notifications on our latest products and services offerings. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/icicibank/videos?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThere is more than one way to connect with us, so be sure to check our ICICI Bank at:\nWebsite: https://www.icicibank.com\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/icicibank\nLinkedIn: https://in.linkedin.com/company/icici-bank\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/icicibank\n\"", "channel_id": "UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "duration": 72, "view_count": 1453, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IC34p5ubpkU", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "chapters": [{"start_time": 0, "end_time": 11.0, "title": "<Untitled Chapter 1>"}, {"start_time": 11.0, "title": "Log in to the Dashboard of ICICI Bank Corporate Internet Banking", "end_time": 16